{"id":1751976,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-19T11:50:36.610Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1751976,"imdb_id":"tt14639524","origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Sweet Chariot","overview":"The influence of black urban blues on many white recording artists is indisputable. Eric Clapton recorded ‘Swing Low Sweet Chariot’ while being responsible for some controversial views on repatriation of immigrants. Taking this irony as its basic theme, this short film attempts to show the way in which white society adopts black culture – focusing on music, dance and fashion – and yet rejects it through racism. It follows an evening in the life of Pauline, a young black woman and a dancer who is confronted by these attitudes on a daily basis.","popularity":0.0071,"poster_path":null,"production_companies":[],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"","revenue":0,"runtime":23,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Sweet Chariot","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":6420703,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Pat Donaldson","original_name":"Pat Donaldson","popularity":0,"profile_path":null,"cast_id":3,"character":"","credit_id":"6a847b3a8bc2905160ac904e","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":6420705,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Nancy Johnson","original_name":"Nancy Johnson","popularity":0,"profile_path":null,"cast_id":4,"character":"","credit_id":"6a847b5450faa13a2d3dacd0","order":1},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":6420706,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Dennis Osbourne","original_name":"Dennis Osbourne","popularity":0,"profile_path":null,"cast_id":5,"character":"","credit_id":"6a847b648bc2905160ac9060","order":2}],"crew":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":3661594,"known_for_department":"Crew","name":"Yugesh Walia","ori